- V2-R07 covers failed and unknown issuance and rejected and unknown deletion as named in screens/reviews-administration.md.
- Live: one topic review apply and read-back against Redtail under the `airs-v2-c25-` prefix with cleanup, inside the owner scope. Key issuance and deletion are not run live in P09 (covered by C09 fixtures and C25 L-rows).

